{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1238542-2nd-edition-with-scroll-of-errata-respiring-essence-in-the-wyld","id":1238542,"title":"[2nd edition with Scroll of Errata] Respiring essence in the Wyld","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-25T03:46:20-07:00","id":1238542,"title":"[2nd edition with Scroll of Errata] Respiring essence in the Wyld","content":"Hello there, and thanks for answering. I cannot find any clear answers to the question in the headline.<br /> <br /> 1) Can Creation-born respire essence in the Wyld? What is the rate? Is there any difference between Solars, Lunars, etc... (concerning the respiring of Essence)?<br /> <br /> 2) Do raksha regain motes in the Wyld? Is the rate different between Pure Chaos, Deep Wyld, Middlemarches, Bordermarches and Freeholds? Do they regain motes in Tainted Lands? (I guess they don't, as Tainted Lands belong to Creation)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;No, no, don't look any further, my profile is actually more handsome than me&quot;","edited":{"userid":3586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3586-alqamar-alaswad","user":"Alqamar Alaswad","date":". 07-25-2018, 06:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3586-alqamar-alaswad","name":"Alqamar Alaswad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T04:15:27-07:00","id":1238549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alqamar Alaswad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1238542-2nd-edition-with-scroll-of-errata-respiring-essence-in-the-wyld#post1238542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) Can Creation-born respire essence in the Wyld? What is the rate? Is there any difference between Solars, Lunars, etc... (concerning the respiring of Essence)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Creation-born recover essence at the normal rate in the Wyld. Underworld creatures (including Abyssals) cannot recover essence in the Wyld unaided.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alqamar Alaswad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1238542-2nd-edition-with-scroll-of-errata-respiring-essence-in-the-wyld#post1238542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2) Do raksha regain motes in the Wyld? Is the rate different between Pure Chaos, Deep Wyld, Middlemarches, Bordermarches and Freeholds? Do they regain motes in Tainted Lands? (I guess they don't, as Tainted Lands belong to Creation)</div> </div> </div> </div>Rakasha can <i>only</i> regain essence in the Wyld, <i>unless </i>they have appropriate charms to allow them to also do so in Creation. It makes no difference where in the Wyld, but indeed, tainted lands are not in the Wyld. However, waypoints can be ravished so they provide no essence to those who feed only on the damaged virtue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T04:23:12-07:00","id":1238551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Greyman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1238542-2nd-edition-with-scroll-of-errata-respiring-essence-in-the-wyld?p=1238549#post1238549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Creation-born recover essence at the normal rate in the Wyld. Underworld creatures (including Abyssals) cannot recover essence in the Wyld unaided.<br /> <br /> Rakasha can <i>only</i> regain essence in the Wyld, <i>unless </i>they have appropriate charms to allow them to also do so in Creation. It makes no difference where in the Wyld, but indeed, tainted lands are not in the Wyld. However, waypoints can be ravished so they provide no essence to those who feed only on the damaged virtue.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks a lot for your answers!<br /> <br /> However, how much essence do raksha recover in the Wyld? Normal rate?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;No, no, don't look any further, my profile is actually more handsome than me&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3586-alqamar-alaswad","name":"Alqamar Alaswad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T07:18:12-07:00","id":1238578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alqamar Alaswad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1238542-2nd-edition-with-scroll-of-errata-respiring-essence-in-the-wyld?p=1238551#post1238551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks a lot for your answers!<br /> <br /> However, how much essence do raksha recover in the Wyld? Normal rate?</div> </div> </div> </div>Normal rate unless their stasis hits full, in which case even the Wyld just works like Creation for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/357-plotvitalnpc","name":"PlotVitalNPC","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar357_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}